job_pleiades.sh
================
version Jan 3 2026
(re)install directory run_realtime
Runs steady-state with the latest magnetogram (cron job for updating
magnetogram should run continuously).
After steady-state the real-time-accurate sumulation series start
The run stops after the simulation reaches the real-time. After this
the cronjob operating recurrent runs should work continuously (series of 24
runs restarts every day).

job_recurrent_pleiades.py
=================
Version Jan 3 2026
Run 24 times the real-time simulations each with the newly updated magnetogram

job_recurrent_cron.py
=================
Version Jan 3 2026
Run 24 times the real-time simulations each with the newly updated magnetogram
Limit the computational time by 23 hours 20 minutes
